=== Does the transport prediction actually work? ===
  correlation between PREDICTED and ACTUAL anchor r across 8000 genes:
    CGGA-693    cor(pred, actual) = 0.868    vs cor(TCGA r, actual) = 0.882  [6 strata, 100% of R's patients]
